# THE KEYS PLAY (0.17.6): on any page a key plays a voice (the page's own: pad, bass, acid, pluck; elsewhere the Jam page's), as the Jam
# page plays it; only on Global do they put the scale's notes in and out (a key played by mistake used to change the scale)
seed 0
wait 3000
expect view 0
expect pool 0x5AD
tapkey 1
wait 100
expect pool 0x5AD
# the pad's page: the key plays the pad, held while it is
turn SELECT 1 100
wait 300
expect view 1
key 13 down
wait 200
expect held 1
expect pool 0x5AD
key 13 up
wait 200
expect held 0
# the bass's page: the bass
turn SELECT 5 100
wait 300
expect view 6
key 8 down
wait 200
expect held 1
key 8 up
wait 200
expect held 0
# Global: the keys are the scale (F#3 in, then out again); the root stays
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 32
tapkey 1
wait 100
expect pool 0x7AD
shot keys_global_scale.png
tapkey 1
wait 100
expect pool 0x5AD
